OL,3,ARobert Pattinson named as new James
OL,4,ABond, ending long hunt for Daniel
OL,5,ACraig's replacement
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeculation about Daniel Craig's
OL,8,Freplacement has been rife, with actors
OL,9,Fincluding Josh O'Connor, Callum Turner
OL,10,Fand Jack Lowden thought to have made it
OL,11,Fto the final screen tests
OL,13,FThanking those who auditioned,
OL,14,FVilleneuve says "we were surrounded by
OL,15,Fextraordinary talent", adding Pattinson
OL,16,F"brings a spirit that is completely
OL,17,Fnew"
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
