OL,3,AYemeni forces retreat to defend port
OL,4,Acity from Houthis
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemeni pro-government forces backed by
OL,7,FSaudi Arabia say they are redeploying
OL,8,Ftroops to defend the country's interim
OL,9,Fcapital, Aden, following weeks of
OL,10,Fintensified fighting with the
OL,11,FIran-backed Houthi movement.
OL,13,FThe Southern Armed Forces said it was
OL,14,Fwithdrawing from an area overlooking
OL,15,Fthe strategically important Bab
OL,16,Fal-Mandab Strait, at the southern end
OL,17,Fof the Red Sea, to reinforce positions
OL,18,Faround Aden and neighbouring areas.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
