OL,3,ATrump says he wouldn't mind seeing
OL,4,AHuang return to Nvidia
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,F"would certainly not mind" seeing
OL,8,FJensen Huang handed back his job as
OL,9,Fallies of the former Nvidia chief
OL,10,Fexecutive call for him to be
OL,11,Freinstated.
OL,13,FHuang resigned as boss of the AI chip
OL,14,Fgiant last week after the emergence of
OL,15,Ftwo affairs, one of whom was with a
OL,16,Fwoman suspected of spying for China and
OL,17,Fanother allegedly with one of his
OL,18,Femployees.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
