OL,3,ATrump says he wouldn't mind seeing
OL,4,AHuang return to Nvidia
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has created a crisis for one of the
OL,7,Fworld's most valuable firms, which is a
OL,8,Fkey part of the AI industry and its
OL,9,Fhuge expansion.
OL,11,FBut now fellow tech bosses, including
OL,12,FSpaceX's Elon Musk and Tim Sweeney
OL,13,Fchief executive of Fortnite-maker Epic
OL,14,FGames, have backed a campaign to get
OL,15,FNvidia's board to "Bring Jensen Back".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
